pan></td><td><span class="">send_double_optin</span></td><td><span class="">Notifies recipient</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class="">revert_registration</span></td><td><span class="">yes</span></td><td><span class="">record_decision</span></td><td><span class="">Writes reversal entry, never deletes</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class="">reassign_work_packages</span></td><td><span class="">yes</span></td><td><span class="">create_work_packages</span></td><td><span class="">Requires target lead</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class="">void_statement</span></td><td><span class="">yes</span></td><td><span class="">issue_statement</span></td><td><span class="">Financial reversal, not delete</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class="">abort_export</span></td><td><span class="">yes</span></td><td><span class="">start_export</span></td><td><span class="">Deletes temp export artifact</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class="">soft_delete_tenant_data</span></td><td><span class="">no (one-way)</span></td><td><span class="">—</span></td><td><span class="">Irreversible; requires step-up</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h2><span class="">5. Cross-engine compatibility rules</span></h2><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class="">A Journey YAML is valid for an engine if and only if:</span></p><ul><li><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><code>execution_hints.engine</code><span class=""> matches the adapter</span></p></li><li><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class="">Every </span><code>wait</code><span class=""> state duration ≤ adapter's max durable wait</span></p></li><li><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class="">Every gate type is supported by the adapter</span></p></li><li><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class="">Every compensation action exists in the adapter's compensation registry</span></p></li></ul><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class="">The adapter validates at registration and rejects with a typed error listing</span><br><span class="">the violating 