26 3.19372 14.0126 2.95098C13.7974 2.57849 13.4876 2.26869 13.1151 2.05352C12.8724 1.91347 12.5564 1.82237 12.0253 1.77423C11.4847 1.72528 10.7888 1.7254 9.80164 1.7254H7.71472C6.7562 1.72558 5.92665 2.27697 5.52332 3.07891H4.07019C4.54221 1.51132 5.9932 0.368186 7.71472 0.367975H9.80164Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><span class="ds-button__content"><span class="code-info-button-text">Copy</span></span></div><div role="button" class="ds-button ds-button--borderlessNeutral ds-button--borderless ds-button--capsule ds-button--xs ds-button--icon-relative-m ds-button--min-width" tabindex="0"><div class="ds-button__background"></div><div class="ds-button__icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M15.3695 11.411L15.1234 12.8866C14.8869 14.3042 13.6603 15.3436 12.223 15.3436H3.77673C2.33958 15.3434 1.1128 14.3042 0.876343 12.8866L0.630249 11.411L2.05408 11.1747L2.29919 12.6493C2.41973 13.3713 3.04475 13.9001 3.77673 13.9003H12.223C12.9551 13.9002 13.58 13.3713 13.7006 12.6493L13.9457 11.1747L15.3695 11.411ZM8.72205 8.994C8.77717 8.93934 8.83792 8.88106 8.90271 8.81627L12.4828 5.23424L13.5043 6.25572L9.92224 9.8358C9.6395 10.1185 9.38763 10.3732 9.15857 10.5575C8.91892 10.7503 8.63953 10.9224 8.2865 10.9784C8.09711 11.0083 7.90363 11.0083 7.71423 10.9784C7.36106 10.9224 7.0809 10.7503 6.84119 10.5575C6.61215 10.3732 6.36022 10.1185 6.07751 9.8358L2.49646 6.25572L3.51697 5.23424L7.09705 8.81627C7.16219 8.88142 7.22331 8.94006 7.27869 8.99498V1.3065H8.72205V8.994Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><span class="ds-button__content"><span class="code-info-button-text">Download</span></span></div></div></div></div></div></div><pre><span></span>
<span>**Subject** is one of:</span>
<span>- `Hat(hatId)` — a human acting in a capacity</span>
<span>- `AgentPrincipal(agentId)` — a machine acting under a bound Hat</span>
<span></span>
<span>**Evaluation order (short-circuit; each step logs its outcome):**</span>
<span></span>
<span>| Order | Check | Failure result |</span>
<span>|---|---|---|</span>
<span>| 1 | Authenticated? | 401 |</span>
<span>| 2 | Subject valid and not expired? | 403 `SUBJECT_EXPIRED` |</span>
<span>| 3 | Workspace isolation (RLS + app filter) | 404 (never 403 — G4 non-leak) |</span>
<span>| 4 | Capacity permits the Action category (RBAC) | 403 `INSUFFICIENT_CAPACITY` |</span>
<span>| 5 | Relationship/Agreement permits (ReBAC) | 403 `NO_AGREEMENT` |</span>
<span>| 6 | Attribute/classification permits (+ step-up) | 403 `STEP_UP_REQUIRED` or `CLASSIFICATION_DENIED` |</span>
<span>| 7 | Purpose/Consent permits | 403 `CONSENT_REQUIRED` / `CONSENT_REVOKED` |</span>
<span>| 8 | Entitlement permits (plan) | 402 `UPGRADE_REQUIRED` |</span>
<span></span>
<span>**Rule:** a Tenant filter alone is NEVER the security model (SR-02). Steps 3</span>
<span>and 4 are always both required.</span>
<span></span>
<span>## 5. Persona → Capability mapping (the missing table, G-A18)</span>
<span></span>
<span>v1.1 listed 11 personas with no mapping. Here it is. Persona is **derived**,</span>
<span>never asserted.</span>
<span></span>
<span>| Persona | Derived from Hat capacity | Default landing | Default nav sections |</span>
<span>|---|---|---|---|</span>
<span>| Channel Leader | ProgramSponsor, Scope=WholeOrg | Today | Today, Network, Work, Programs, Money, Evidence |</span>
<span>| Partner Ops | ProgramPartner or ProgramSponsor, Scope=OneProgram | Today | Today, Programs, Content, Evidence |</span>
<span>| Partner Rep | ProgramPartner, Scope=OneProgram | Today | Today, Network, Work |</span>
<span>| Delivery Lead | ProgramPartner, Scope=OneJourney | Today | Today, Work |</span>
<span>| Buyer / Procurement | Buyer, Scope=OneRelationship | Network | Network, Today |</span>
<span>| Marketer | ProgramSponsor, Scope=WholeOrg | Content | Content, Programs |</span>
<span>| Finance | ProgramSponsor, Scope=WholeOrg | Money | Money, Work |</span>
<span>| Compliance | ProgramSponsor or ProgramPartner | Evidence | Evidence, Programs |</span>
<span>| Org Admin | OrgAdmin, Scope=WholeOrg | Settings | Settings, Today, Evidence |</span>
<span>| Platform Admin | (platform scope) | Admin | Admin only |</span>
<span>| Platform Reviewer | (platform scope) | Admin | Admin queues |</span>
<span>| Agent Operator | Buyer or ProgramSponsor | Today | Today, Network (read-only) |</span>
<span></span>
<span>**Implementation:** `PersonaResolver.Resolve(hat) → Persona`. Deterministic.</span>
<span>No user may choose a persona that the Hat does not derive to; the UI may allow</span>
<span>an override only within the set of personas the Hat derives to.</span>
