186 7.71472 0.367975H9.80164Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><span class="ds-button__content"><span class="code-info-button-text">Copy</span></span></div><div role="button" class="ds-button ds-button--borderlessNeutral ds-button--borderless ds-button--capsule ds-button--xs ds-button--icon-relative-m ds-button--min-width" tabindex="0"><div class="ds-button__background"></div><div class="ds-button__icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M15.3695 11.411L15.1234 12.8866C14.8869 14.3042 13.6603 15.3436 12.223 15.3436H3.77673C2.33958 15.3434 1.1128 14.3042 0.876343 12.8866L0.630249 11.411L2.05408 11.1747L2.29919 12.6493C2.41973 13.3713 3.04475 13.9001 3.77673 13.9003H12.223C12.9551 13.9002 13.58 13.3713 13.7006 12.6493L13.9457 11.1747L15.3695 11.411ZM8.72205 8.994C8.77717 8.93934 8.83792 8.88106 8.90271 8.81627L12.4828 5.23424L13.5043 6.25572L9.92224 9.8358C9.6395 10.1185 9.38763 10.3732 9.15857 10.5575C8.91892 10.7503 8.63953 10.9224 8.2865 10.9784C8.09711 11.0083 7.90363 11.0083 7.71423 10.9784C7.36106 10.9224 7.0809 10.7503 6.84119 10.5575C6.61215 10.3732 6.36022 10.1185 6.07751 9.8358L2.49646 6.25572L3.51697 5.23424L7.09705 8.81627C7.16219 8.88142 7.22331 8.94006 7.27869 8.99498V1.3065H8.72205V8.994Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><span class="ds-button__content"><span class="code-info-button-text">Download</span></span></div></div></div></div></div></div><pre><span><span class="token title important"><span class="token punctuation">#</span> Agent Orchestration Protocol</span></span>
<span>Purpose: Let 3–4 humans plus AI agents produce consistent artifacts without</span>
<span>losing progress, without spec drift, and without duplicating work.</span>
<span></span>
<span><span class="token title important"><span class="token punctuation">##</span> 1. Four roles. Strict boundaries. No overlap.</span></span>
<span></span>
<span><span class="token table"><span class="token table-header-row"><span class="token punctuation">|</span><span class="token table-header important"> Role </span><span class="token punctuation">|</span><span class="token table-header important"> Reads </span><span class="token punctuation">|</span><span class="token table-header important"> Produces </span><span class="token punctuation">|</span><span class="token table-header important"> MUST NOT </span><span class="token punctuation">|</span></span></span></span>
<span><span class="token table-line"><span class="token punctuation">|</span><span class="token punctuation">---</span><span class="token punctuation">|</span><span class="token punctuation">---</span><span class="token punctuation">|</span><span class="token punctuation">---</span><span class="token punctuation">|</span><span class="token punctuation">---</span><span class="token punctuation">|</span></span></span>
<span><span class="token table-data-rows"><span class="token punctuation">|</span><span class="token table-data"> <span class="token bold"><span class="token punctuation">**</span><span class="token content">Auditor</span><span class="token punctuation">**</span></span> </span><span class="token punctuation">|</span><span class="token table-data"> Source code, v1.1, existing artifacts </span><span class="token punctuation">|</span><span class="token table-data"> Fact tables (01, 11) </span><span class="token punctuation">|</span><span class="token table-data"> Design, recommend, fix, or write code </span><span class="token punctuation">|</span></span></span>
<span><span class="token punctuation">|</span><span class="token table-data"> <span class="token bold"><span class="token punctuation">**</span><span class="token content">Planner</span><span class="token punctuation">**</span></span> </span><span class="token punctuation">|</span><span class="token table-data"> Auditor output + 13-master-prompt </span><span class="token punctuation">|</span><span class="token table-data"> Specs (03,04,05,06,07,08,09,10) </span><span class="token punctuation">|</span><span class="token table-data"> Write code; invent facts; skip [A]/[L] markers </span><span class="token punctuation">|</span></span>
<span><span class="token punctuation">|</span><span class="token table-data"> <span class="token bold"><span class="token punctuation">**</span><span class="token content">Executor</span><span class="token punctuation">**</span></span> </span><span class="token punctuation">|</span><span class="token table-data"> One Planner artifact </span><span class="token punctuation">|</span><span class="token table-data"> Code + tests </span><span class="token punctuation">|</span><span class="token table-data"> Invent domain rules; deviate from spec; skip a failing test </span><span class="token punctuation">|</span></span>
<span><span class="token punctuation">|</span><span class="token table-data"> <span class="token bold"><span class="token punctuation">**</span><span class="token content">Reviewer</span><span class="token punctuation">**</span></span> </span><span class="token punctuation">|</span><span class="token table-data"> Executor output + 03 + 07 </span><span class="token punctuation">|</span><span class="token table-data"> Pass/fail report with violation IDs </span><span class="token punctuation">|</span><span class="token table-data"> Edit code or spec; pass a build with a P0 finding </span><span class="token punctuation">|</span></span>
<span></span>
<span><span class="token bold"><span class="token punctuation">**</span><span class="token content">The rule that makes this work:</span><span class="token punctuation">**</span></span> the Reviewer's rejections go <span class="token bold"><span class="token punctuation">**</span><span class="token content">back to the</span></span></span>
<span>Executor, never to the Planner mid-flight.<span class="token punctuation">**</span> If the Planner's spec was wrong,</span>
<span>the Reviewer escalates to the human, who decides whether to re-run the Planner.</span>
<span>This prevents spec drift during implementation.</span>
<span></span>
<span><span class="token title important"><span class="token punctuation">##</span> 2. File-based handoff (no chat history)</span></span>
<span></span>
<span>Every artifact is a file in <span class="token code-snippet code keyword">`/docs/architecture/`</span> or <span class="token code-snippet code keyword">`/docs/work/`</span>.</span>
<span>Every agent prompt begins with the exact file list it may read.</span>
<span>No agent may read another agent's conversation.</span>
